    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jan 2025 09:12:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位调休快乐哈哈，距离过年还有两天，跟大家聊聊关于俗气这件事儿。承认俗气也是一种勇气，世界的规则也是为了我们俗人设置的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容大致如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">1:24</a> 谈钱真的是一件很俗的事情吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">4:04</a> 女性拒绝被功利绑架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">6:31</a> 其实各行各业都在功利性的发展着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 并不是有欲望就是俗气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 俗气的恶意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 俗气何尝不是一种生活气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 对“不功利不俗气”的祛魅</span></p><span></span><p><span>世界本就是俗气，俗气的人了解世俗的规则，说不定比脱俗的人过得好呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：DRLNG——Club2Tokyo/Lavera/Walker Manning</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;outofsnax——luvbird/lbrahim</span></p>]]></description>
